83705	83849	83688	83688	he	8855	“ Ajaxes , you two can be the saving of the Achaeans if you will put out all your strength and not let yourselves be daunted . I am not afraid that the Trojans , who have got over the wall in force , will be victorious in any other part , for the Achaeans can hold all of them in check , but I much fear that some evil will befall us here where furious Hector , who boasts himself the son of great Jove himself , is leading them on like a pillar of flame . May some god , then , put it into your hearts to make a firm stand here , and to incite others to do the like . In this case you will drive him from the ships even though he be inspired by Jove himself . ”
