118127	118297	118119	118119	he	1098	“ Alas ! what shall I do ? I may not let the Trojans take the armour of Patroclus who has fallen fighting on my behalf , lest some Danaan who sees me should cry shame upon me . Still if for my honour ’s sake I fight Hector and the Trojans single - handed , they will prove too many for me , for Hector is bringing them up in force . Why , however , should I thus hesitate ? When a man fights in despite of heaven with one whom a god befriends , he will soon rue it . Let no Danaan think ill of me if I give place to Hector , for the hand of heaven is with him . Yet , if I could find Ajax , the two of us would fight Hector and heaven too , if we might only save the body of Patroclus for Achilles son of Peleus . This , of many evils would be the least . ”
