173815	173894	173812	173812	he	624	“ take me to my couch that we may lie down and enjoy the blessed boon of sleep . Never once have my eyes been closed from the day your hands took the life of my son ; I have grovelled without ceasing in the mire of my stable - yard , making moan and brooding over my countless sorrows . Now , moreover , I have eaten bread and drunk wine ; hitherto I have tasted nothing . ”
173969	174060	173963	173963	Achilles	431	“ Dear sir , you shall lie outside , lest some counsellor of those who in due course keep coming to advise with me should see you here in the darkness of the flying night , and tell it to Agamemnon . This might cause delay in the delivery of the body . And now tell me and tell me true , for how many days would you celebrate the funeral rites of noble Hector ? Tell me , that I may hold aloof from war and restrain the host . ”
